[19:27:12.037] INFO [opencode-plugin] permission_final_args {"sessionId":"ses_17d1b945affecoWx4fO1wbqS6v","message":"final _output.args: {\"content\":\"# User Profile\\n\\n## Jethro Lai\\n\\n### Role & Field\\n- Clinical/medical domain — focus areas visible in Zotero: Psychiatry, FMPC (medicine), ICU/critical care\\n- Working/studying in areas: mental health, consultation-liaison, ICU outcomes, ML applied to ICU\\n- Has a \\\"Learning and Note-taking\\\" collection suggesting active academic work\\n\\n### PKM Setup\\n- **Zotero**: linked PDF storage at `G:\\\\我的雲端硬碟\\\\ZoteroLibrary` (organized by author surname / year)\\n- **Obsidian**: vault \\\"Notes\\\", active daily notes from Feb 2025\\n- **Preferred citation format in frontmatter**: short citation (e.g. \\\"Smith et al., 2023\\\"), NOT Zotero key or DOI\\n\\n### Preferences\\n- Does NOT use scratchpad — only skill files and agent config as persistent reference\\n- Prefers concise, direct interaction — no fluff\\n- Updates to skill files are welcome and expected as I learn more about the setup\",\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\jethr\\\\.mavis\\\\memory\\\\user.md\"}"}
